            "detailed_description": "<h1>Características</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art</strong>: High-speed action rendered in beautiful, chaotic 8-bit style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: Procedural levels and diverse biomes keep the challenge fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Race against friends and strangers to see who can dodge the meteors longest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression</strong>: Unlockable items, stat upgrades, and a massive wardrobe of hats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Physics</strong>: Jump, duck, and tumble through a world that reacts to the oncoming disaster.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic prehistoric racer returns! <i>DINO RUN DX</i> is a massive, colorful upgrade to the legendary pixelated platformer that defined the runner genre. You are a raptor on the brink of extinction, and your only hope is to outrun the literal end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/5a22f8a3f34ed79f84535e5f6e51ad5a.poster.avif?t=1791217285\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/5a22f8a3f34ed79f84535e5f6e51ad5a.webm?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/5a22f8a3f34ed79f84535e5f6e51ad5a.mp4?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Original Prehistoric Runner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover the game that started it all, now refined and expanded for the ultimate extinction experience. Escape the ever-approaching <strong>Wall of Doom</strong> as it consumes everything in its path, from lush jungles to crumbling volcanic landscapes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run for Your Life:</strong> Navigate treacherous terrain filled with deep craters, sticky tar pits, and stampeding triceratops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Peril:</strong> Every run is different. Dive into <strong>endless, procedurally generated landscapes</strong> that ensure no two escapes are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Customization:</strong> Customize the iconic raptor to your heart's content. Choose your colors and unlock <strong>lots and lots of hats</strong> to face the apocalypse in style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/14339992e64ba99d6cfc1b506a49b7db.poster.avif?t=1791217285\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/14339992e64ba99d6cfc1b506a49b7db.webm?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/14339992e64ba99d6cfc1b506a49b7db.mp4?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about speed; it’s about survival of the fittest. Collect points, grab rare eggs, and find hidden artifacts to ensure your species lives to see another era.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Dino:</strong> Use your hard-earned points to boost your stats and improve your chances of outrunning the pyroclastic flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles &amp; High Scores:</strong> Hunt for eggs and bones to climb the leaderboards. In <i>Dino Run DX</i>, progress means power (and fashion).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong> Tailor your extinction to your skill level with 4 distinct challenge settings, ranging from &quot;chill&quot; exploration to &quot;impossible&quot; prehistoric chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/2d42764518cf2507bea724aac31a3fe3.poster.avif?t=1791217285\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/2d42764518cf2507bea724aac31a3fe3.webm?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/2d42764518cf2507bea724aac31a3fe3.mp4?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Nostalgic Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a &quot;colorful take on the classic&quot; that combines retro aesthetics with modern gameplay polish. Whether you’re a veteran of the original web game or a new runner, Dino Run DX is guaranteed to make you shed a single nostalgic tear as you race against time. The meteor is coming. The wall is closing in. Can you outrun extinction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/1d9e67718af4175869170e7755535a39.poster.avif?t=1791217285\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/1d9e67718af4175869170e7755535a39.webm?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/1d9e67718af4175869170e7755535a39.mp4?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic prehistoric racer returns! <i>DINO RUN DX</i> is a massive, colorful upgrade to the legendary pixelated platformer that defined the runner genre. You are a raptor on the brink of extinction, and your only hope is to outrun the literal end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/5a22f8a3f34ed79f84535e5f6e51ad5a.poster.avif?t=1791217285\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/5a22f8a3f34ed79f84535e5f6e51ad5a.webm?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/5a22f8a3f34ed79f84535e5f6e51ad5a.mp4?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Original Prehistoric Runner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover the game that started it all, now refined and expanded for the ultimate extinction experience. Escape the ever-approaching <strong>Wall of Doom</strong> as it consumes everything in its path, from lush jungles to crumbling volcanic landscapes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run for Your Life:</strong> Navigate treacherous terrain filled with deep craters, sticky tar pits, and stampeding triceratops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Peril:</strong> Every run is different. Dive into <strong>endless, procedurally generated landscapes</strong> that ensure no two escapes are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Customization:</strong> Customize the iconic raptor to your heart's content. Choose your colors and unlock <strong>lots and lots of hats</strong> to face the apocalypse in style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/14339992e64ba99d6cfc1b506a49b7db.poster.avif?t=1791217285\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/14339992e64ba99d6cfc1b506a49b7db.webm?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/14339992e64ba99d6cfc1b506a49b7db.mp4?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about speed; it’s about survival of the fittest. Collect points, grab rare eggs, and find hidden artifacts to ensure your species lives to see another era.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Dino:</strong> Use your hard-earned points to boost your stats and improve your chances of outrunning the pyroclastic flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles &amp; High Scores:</strong> Hunt for eggs and bones to climb the leaderboards. In <i>Dino Run DX</i>, progress means power (and fashion).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong> Tailor your extinction to your skill level with 4 distinct challenge settings, ranging from &quot;chill&quot; exploration to &quot;impossible&quot; prehistoric chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/2d42764518cf2507bea724aac31a3fe3.poster.avif?t=1791217285\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/2d42764518cf2507bea724aac31a3fe3.webm?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/2d42764518cf2507bea724aac31a3fe3.mp4?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Nostalgic Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a &quot;colorful take on the classic&quot; that combines retro aesthetics with modern gameplay polish. Whether you’re a veteran of the original web game or a new runner, Dino Run DX is guaranteed to make you shed a single nostalgic tear as you race against time. The meteor is coming. The wall is closing in. Can you outrun extinction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/1d9e67718af4175869170e7755535a39.poster.avif?t=1791217285\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/1d9e67718af4175869170e7755535a39.webm?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/248330/extras/1d9e67718af4175869170e7755535a39.mp4?t=1791217285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
